    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is syndon \u00fea laga, \u00fee \u00e6\u00f0elred cyng & his witan ger\u00e6dd habba\u00f0 \u00e6t Wanetingc to fri\u00f0es bote. \u00d0\u00e6t is: \u00fe\u00e6t his gri\u00f0 stande swa for\u00f0, swa hit fyrmest stod on his yldrena dagum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t sy botleas, \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fe\u00e6t gri\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se ealdormann & kinges gerefa on Fif burga ge\u00feinc\u00f0a sylle, bete man \u00fe\u00e6t mid XII And \u00fe\u00e6t gri\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man sylle\u00f0 on I burhga\u00fein\u00f0e, bete man \u00fe\u00e6t mid VI hundrum; and \u00fe\u00e6r man sylle on And \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t man cy\u00f0e mid gewitnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man \u00fe\u00e6t ne awende \u00e6t cwicon \u00fee ma \u00fee \u00e6t deadon. & gange \u00e6lc man \u00fe\u00e6s to gewitnesse, \u00fee he durre on \u00feam haligdome swerian, \u00fee him man on hand syl\u00f0. And landcop & hlafordes gifu, \u00fee he on riht age to gifanne, & lahcop & witword & gewitnes, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fe\u00e6t man habbe gemot on \u00e6lcum w\u00e6penkace; & gan ut \u00fea yldestan XII \u00feegnas & se gerefa mid, & & niman \u00feonne \u00fea tihtbysian men, \u00fee mid \u00feam gerefan habba\u00f0, & heora \u00e6lc sylle VI healfmarc wedd, & \u00e6lc bicge him lage mid XII oran, healf landrican, healf w\u00e6pentake. & \u00e6lc tihtbysig man gange to \u00feryfeldan ordale o\u00f0\u00f0e gilde feowergilde. Gif se hlaford \u00feonne hine ladian wylle mid twam godum \u00feegenum, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre \u00feeofgild ne gulde, Gif he \u00feonne ful beo, slea man hine,",
